WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.303
[rapid knocking on door]

00:00:06.472 --> 00:00:08.441
[buzzer]

00:00:13.712 --> 00:00:15.615
- HEY, MAN.
HOW YOU DOING?

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:17.083
YOU GUYS GOT BOW AND ARROWS?

00:00:17.116 --> 00:00:20.520
- YEAH.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:21.821
- OH, YEAH.
OH, THAT'S IT.

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:23.122
YEAH, THERE IT IS.
THERE.

00:00:23.155 --> 00:00:24.290
THAT'LL DO IT.
THAT'S GONNA DO IT.

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:25.525
YUP.
WHERE ARE THE ARROWS AT?

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:27.360
[clears throat]

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:29.028
YEAH.
YOU GOT--YOU GUYS GOT M80s?

00:00:29.061 --> 00:00:30.863
- WE DON'T CARRY FIREWORKS.

00:00:30.896 --> 00:00:32.165
- DAMN!
YOU HAVE, UH--

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.733
YOU HAVE SOMETHING ELSE
THAT'S EXPLOSIVE

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:35.835
THAT I COULD TAPE
TO THE END OF AN ARROW?

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:39.372
- WE HAVE SHOTGUN SHELLS, BUT...
- UH-HUH. OOH.

00:00:39.405 --> 00:00:40.706
- I FEEL I HAVE TO ASK,

00:00:40.739 --> 00:00:42.241
ARE YOU PLANNING
TO ATTACH THOSE TO ARROWS

00:00:42.274 --> 00:00:43.776
AND USE THEM AS A WEAPON?

00:00:43.809 --> 00:00:44.877
- WHAT?
NO. WHAT?

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.112
ARE YOU CRAZY?
[laughs]

00:00:46.145 --> 00:00:47.280
YOU THINK
THAT WOULD WORK THOUGH?

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:49.449
WHAT--WHAT--WHAT IF I SHOT
EXPLOSIVE ARROWS

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:51.317
THROUGH A WINDOW
TO BREAK 'EM OPEN?

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:53.319
- SIR, I FEEL LIKE
I HAVE TO ASK YOU

00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:55.555
WHAT YOU'RE PLANNING
TO USE THESE FOR.

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:56.823
- OH, NO, I'M NOT PLANNING
TO DO ANYTHING.

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:58.324
I'M JUST--THIS IS
JUST CHRISTMAS SHOPPING.

00:00:58.357 --> 00:00:59.425
I'M GETTING A--
YOU GOT ZIP LINES?

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:00.726
- NOPE.

00:01:00.759 --> 00:01:01.894
- BUT YOU GOT, LIKE,
HOOKS AND ANCHORS AND CABLES?

00:01:01.927 --> 00:01:03.196
- WE GOT
SOME OF THOSE THINGS,

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:06.799
BUT I DO NOT RECOMMEND
MANUFACTURING YOUR OWN ZIP LINE.

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:08.901
- OH, I'M NOT DOING THAT.
NO.

00:01:08.934 --> 00:01:10.303
LET'S SAY SOMEBODY
WAS MANUFACTURING

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:11.838
THEIR OWN ZIP LINE.
- MM-HMM.

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:13.039
- YOU THINK IF THEY
HAD BUSTED SOME WINDOWS OPEN

00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:14.273
ON A BUILDING SOMEHOW,

00:01:14.306 --> 00:01:16.776
THEN FIRED THE ZIP LINE
OFF A BOW AND ARROW,

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:18.711
AND IT ATTACHED
TO THE WALL OF SAID BUILDING,

00:01:18.744 --> 00:01:20.980
THAT THEY COULD JUST RIDE
THE ZIP LINE INTO THE BUILDING?

00:01:21.013 --> 00:01:22.748
- I HAVE NO IDEA.

00:01:22.781 --> 00:01:24.984
SIR, WHATEVER YOU
ARE PLANNING ON DOING,

00:01:25.017 --> 00:01:26.486
PLEASE DON'T DO IT.

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:27.920
- I'M NOT--I'M NOT--
I'M NOT DOING ANYTHING.

00:01:27.953 --> 00:01:29.288
I'M JUST DOING
SOME CHRISTMAS SHOPPING,

00:01:29.321 --> 00:01:30.423
TRYING TO GET IT
OUT OF THE WAY.

00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:31.757
YOU KNOW, BOW AND ARROWS
FOR MY NEPHEW.

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:34.393
THE ZIP LINE'S FOR MY...
GRANDMOTHER.

00:01:34.426 --> 00:01:36.095
ET CETERA AND WHATNOT.
YOU KNOW WHAT I'M SAYING THERE?

00:01:36.128 --> 00:01:37.563
IT'S NOTHING.
NO BIG DEAL.

00:01:37.596 --> 00:01:39.031
SPEAKING OF OTHER THINGS,
DO YOU GUYS HAVE

00:01:39.064 --> 00:01:43.269
JUST THE, UH, TOP HALF
OF A KNIGHT IN ARMOR?

00:01:43.302 --> 00:01:45.638
- FIRST OF ALL,
IT'S CALLED A SUIT OF ARMOR.

00:01:45.671 --> 00:01:47.240
- OH, YUP, THAT'S IT.
THAT'S RIGHT.

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:49.041
THAT'S WHAT I MEANT TO SAY.
- WE HAVE ONE BUT IT'S SOLD...

00:01:49.074 --> 00:01:50.643
- OH!
- AS A COMPLETE SET.

00:01:50.676 --> 00:01:51.811
- YUP. YUP.
- YUP.

00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:53.045
- YEAH,
BUT THE PERSON IT'S FOR,

00:01:53.078 --> 00:01:54.147
THEY ONLY NEED THE--
THEY DON'T NEED THE--

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.348
THEY JUST NEED THE TOP HALF.

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:56.616
THEY DON'T NEED THE LEGS.
- MM-HMM.

00:01:56.649 --> 00:01:58.251
- WELL, WHAT IF SOMEBODY
WAS SHOOTING AT YOU AND--

00:01:58.284 --> 00:01:59.886
WHAT ARE THE CHANCES YOU THINK
THEY'D TRY TO SHOOT YOUR LEGS?

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:02.021
- I FEEL
LIKE I HAVE TO TELL YOU

00:02:02.054 --> 00:02:05.224
THAT A SUIT OF ARMOR
WILL NOT DEFLECT BULLETS.

00:02:05.257 --> 00:02:08.895
- I'LL TAKE MY CHANCES--
WITH CHRISTMAS.

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:11.297
WHICH BRINGS ME, UH,
TO MY NEXT QUESTION.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.466
DO YOU GUYS
HAVE ROLLER SKATES?

00:02:13.499 --> 00:02:15.902
- I THINK WE HAVE A PAIR AROUND.
- UH-HUH.

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:17.370
LET ME ASK YOU A QUESTION.

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:18.671
HOW FAST DO YOU THINK YOU'D HAVE
TO BE GOING ON ROLLER SKATES

00:02:18.704 --> 00:02:20.173
TO GET PAST A COUPLE
OF ARMED GUARDS

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.575
AND STILL BE GOING FAST ENOUGH
TO SMASH THROUGH A SAFE DOOR?

00:02:22.608 --> 00:02:24.744
- ONE OF THOSE BIG BANK SAFES?
- NO!

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:26.412
I DON--I DON'T KNOW.
YEAH.

00:02:26.445 --> 00:02:29.248
YEAH? UH...

00:02:29.281 --> 00:02:30.983
HEY, YOU GUYS GOT ONE OF THOSE,
YOU KNOW, JUST ONE

00:02:31.016 --> 00:02:33.419
OF THOSE BIG BAGS WITH
A DOLLAR SIGN ON THE SIDE OF IT?

00:02:33.452 --> 00:02:34.587
- OKAY.
- [snorts]

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.622
[coughs]
YEAH?

00:02:36.655 --> 00:02:38.925
- YOU'RE GONNA SHOOT ARROWS WITH
SHOTGUN SHELLS ATTACHED TO 'EM

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:40.793
TO A BANK WINDOW
TO BLOW OUT THE GLASS.

00:02:40.826 --> 00:02:43.129
THEN YOU'RE GONNA SHOOT
A ZIP LINE THROUGH THAT WINDOW

00:02:43.162 --> 00:02:45.231
AND YOU'RE GONNA SLIDE ON
INTO THE HALLWAY.

00:02:45.264 --> 00:02:46.999
YOU'RE GONNA BE
WEARING ROLLER SKATES

00:02:47.032 --> 00:02:49.101
SO YOU CAN JUST SKATE ON PAST
THE ARMED GUARDS,

00:02:49.134 --> 00:02:51.370
WHO WILL BE SHOOTING AT YOU,
AND YOU'RE GONNA HOPE

00:02:51.403 --> 00:02:52.838
THAT THEY BOTH
WON'T HIT YOUR LEGS,

00:02:52.871 --> 00:02:54.941
AND, IF THEY ARE AIMING
AT YOUR TORSO,

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:57.176
THE SUIT OF MEDIEVAL ARMOR
WILL DEFLECT THE BULLETS.

00:02:57.209 --> 00:02:59.445
THEN YOU'RE GONNA HOPE
TO GATHER ENOUGH SPEED

00:02:59.478 --> 00:03:01.147
TO BURST THROUGH
THE BIG BANK VAULT

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:02.448
AT THE END OF THE HALLWAY

00:03:02.481 --> 00:03:03.783
WHERE YOU'RE GONNA
COLLECT THE MONEY

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:08.454
IN A CARTOON MONEY BAG.

00:03:08.487 --> 00:03:10.056
- WELL, NO.

00:03:10.089 --> 00:03:11.524
I'M JUST AN UNCLE WHO'S BUYING
SOME [bleep] FOR CHRISTMAS

00:03:11.557 --> 00:03:13.125
AND I, UH, THINK I'LL
TAKE MY BUSINESS ELSEWHERE.

00:03:13.158 --> 00:03:14.560
MERRY CHRISTMAS.

00:03:14.593 --> 00:03:16.262
- IT'S APRIL.

